    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "a4eddf56-52eb-4e2b-874b-16ce7d63e603",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "High Value Targets: Isle of Sgail",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NORTHSEA",
        "PublicId": "121990061832",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/theark/scene_magpie.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 29a8f83b-8c0d-4f45-a104-0c848b4ca2b6).Image",
        "Description": "47. \r\rYou are assigned five High Value Targets (HVTs) at the Isle of Sgail. Below are the listed targets as well as the preferred method for apprehending them;\r\rEliminate Axel Phenniger with a falling object.\rEliminate Muriel Mortensen with a remote explosive. \rEliminate Jebediah Block with fall.\rEliminate Blake Nathaniel via drowning.\rEliminate Rebecca Hale by electrocution.\r\rThere will be a lot of high profile guests at the event, so keep it clean and avoid detection.\r\rGood luck!\rReapingZ",
